    "1,000코인을 이자 5%%로 맡기면 일주일 뒤 얼마가 될까?" : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:77",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du 1.000 Münzen mit 5 %% Zinsen anlegst, wie viel hast du nach einer Woche?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you save 1,000 coins at 5%% interest, how much will you have after a week?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you save 1,000 coins at 5%% interest, how much will you have after a week?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si ahorras 1.000 monedas con un 5 %% de interés, ¿cuánto tendrás al cabo de una semana?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1,000コインを利子5%%であずけたら、1週間後にいくらになるかな？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1,000코인을 이자 5%%로 맡기면 일주일 뒤 얼마가 될까?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
