    "시장 탭 → 우리집 가게 가격표를 함께 보면서, 물건마다 가격이 다른 이유를 이야기해 보세요." : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:40",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schaut euch im Tab „Markt“ gemeinsam die Preisschilder des Ladens an und sprecht darüber, warum Dinge unterschiedlich viel kosten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open the Market tab and look at the shop price tags together. Talk about why different things cost different amounts."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open the Market tab and look at the shop price tags together. Talk about why different things cost different amounts."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la pestaña Mercado, miren juntos los precios de la tienda de casa y hablen de por qué cada cosa cuesta distinto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「マーケット」タブでおみせの値札をいっしょに見ながら、ものによって値段がちがう理由を話してみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시장 탭 → 우리집 가게 가격표를 함께 보면서, 물건마다 가격이 다른 이유를 이야기해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“市场”标签，一起看看小店的价目表，聊聊为什么每样东西的价格不一样。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟「市場」標籤，一起看看小店的價目表，聊聊為什麼每樣東西的價格不一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "시장 탭에서 물가지수와 물가 추이 그래프를 함께 보고, 아래 '인플레이션 체험'으로 실험해 보세요." : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:99",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schaut euch im Tab „Markt“ gemeinsam den Preisindex und die Preisentwicklung an und probiert unten das „Inflations-Experiment“ aus."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look at the price index and price trend graph in the Market tab together, then experiment with the “Inflation Experiment” below."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look at the price index and price trend graph in the Market tab together, then experiment with the “Inflation Experiment” below."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la pestaña Mercado, miren juntos el índice de precios y la gráfica de su evolución, y luego experimenten con «Experimento de inflación» más abajo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「マーケット」タブで物価指数と物価のグラフをいっしょに見て、下の「インフレ体験」で試してみましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시장 탭에서 물가지수와 물가 추이 그래프를 함께 보고, 아래 '인플레이션 체험'으로 실험해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“市场”标签里一起看物价指数和物价走势图，再用下面的“通胀体验”做个实验。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在「市場」標籤裡一起看物價指數和物價走勢圖，再用下面的「通脹體驗」做個實驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "시장 탭에서 투자 상품 가격이 매일 변하는 걸 보며 '사려는 사람이 많으면 오른다'를 이야기해 보세요." : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:109",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beobachtet im Tab „Markt“, wie sich die Preise der Geldanlagen täglich ändern, und sprecht darüber: „Wollen viele kaufen, steigt der Preis.“"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch the investment prices change every day in the Market tab and talk about “when lots of people want to buy, the price goes up”."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch the investment prices change every day in the Market tab and talk about “when lots of people want to buy, the price goes up”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vean en la pestaña Mercado cómo cambian cada día los precios de las inversiones y hablen de «cuando hay mucha gente que quiere comprar, el precio sube»."
