    "이자가 이자를 낳는 것을 '복리'라고 해요. 오래 저축할수록 돈이 눈덩이처럼 불어나요! ⛄️" : {
      "comment" : "SavingsView.swift:110",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn Zinsen wieder Zinsen bringen, nennt man das „Zinseszins“. Je länger du sparst, desto mehr wächst dein Geld wie ein Schneeball! ⛄️"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When interest earns interest, it’s called compound interest. The longer you save, the more your money snowballs! ⛄️"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When interest earns interest, it’s called compound interest. The longer you save, the more your money snowballs! ⛄️"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando los intereses generan más intereses, se llama «interés compuesto». ¡Cuanto más tiempo ahorres, más crece el dinero como una bola de nieve! ⛄️"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利子が利子を生むことを「複利」といいます。長く貯金するほど、お金は雪だるまのようにふえます！⛄️"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이자가 이자를 낳는 것을 '복리'라고 해요. 오래 저축할수록 돈이 눈덩이처럼 불어나요! ⛄️"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利息再生利息，叫做“复利”。存得越久，钱就像雪球一样越滚越大！⛄️"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
