    "저축을 일찍 시작한 사람과 늦게 시작한 사람, 나중에 누가 더 부자가 될까?" : {
      "comment" : "EducationView.swift:87",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn einer früh mit dem Sparen anfängt und ein anderer spät, wer ist später reicher?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If one person starts saving early and another starts late, who ends up richer?"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If one person starts saving early and another starts late, who ends up richer?"
